---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
description: Explore Christine Oswald's educational games, mobile applications, and game development projects.
permalink: /projects/
---
<h1 id="projects-header">Projects</h1>

<section>
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <p>Here are some of the projects I have worked on which include educational games, mobile applications, and game development projects.</p>
</section>

<hr>

<section aria-labelledby="project-list-heading">
    <h2 id="project-list-heading">Project List</h2>

    {% for project in projects %}
        <article>
            <h3><a href="/projects/{{ project.slug }}/">{{ project.name }}</a></h3>

            {% if project.image %}
                <img src="{{ project.image }}" alt="{{ project.imageAlt }}" style="width: 20em;">
            {% endif %}

            <p><strong>Type:</strong> {{ project.type }}</p>
            {% if project.technology %}<p><strong>Technology:</strong> {{ project.technology }}</p>{% endif %}
            <p><strong>Date:</strong> {{ project.date }}</p>
            <p>{{ project.summary }}</p>

            <label for="progress-{{ project.slug }}">Project progress:</label>
            <progress id="progress-{{ project.slug }}" max="100" value="{{ project.progress }}">{{ project.progress }}%</progress>

            <p><a href="/projects/{{ project.slug }}/">View project details</a></p>
        </article>

        {% if not loop.last %}<hr>{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
</section>

<hr>

<section>
    <h2>Contact Preview</h2>
    <iframe src="/contact/" title="Contact page preview" width="400" height="250" loading="lazy">
        Your browser does not support iframes.
    </iframe>
</section>
